{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15170","headline":"宿冯翊夜雨赠主人 · 李益","name":"宿冯翊夜雨赠主人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"危心惊夜雨，起望漫悠悠。\n气耿残灯暗，声繁高树秋。\n凉轩辞夏扇，风幌揽轻裯。\n思绪蓬初断，归期燕暂留。\n关山蔼已失，脸泪逬难收。\n赖君时一笑，方能解四愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15170.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15170","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}